            a: `Open <a href="#/account">Account</a> and use the billing button near the bottom — it opens Stripe's own secure page, where you can cancel, change your plan, update your card or download invoices. Your card details never touch this app, which is why cancelling happens there rather than here.
                <br><br>If you are on the free trial there is nothing to cancel and nothing to pay. It simply ends.`
